{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果下一代超薄手機iPhone Air 2的配置細節再次浮出水面。根據知名爆料人士Digital Chat Station最新披露的信息，蘋果正在為這款新機準備多項硬件升級，包括採用新一代2nm製程處理器、增加一顆後置攝像頭、提升電池容量，並繼續維持超薄機身設計。按照目前的消息，iPhone Air 2預計將於2027年春季與iPhone 18及iPhone 18e一同發佈。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584422.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:04:51.767397+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T06:44:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:17.444239+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:17.444239+00:00","content_hash":"d2e2740f91ad031f8d10941bb04c9ead8222ff375e57c05bb39de595b630b576","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}